NAME "Thinking and Thought Toggle Alignment"
WINDOW 100 30
TARGET both

# Turn 1 Mock Response
MOCK_TURN
  THOUGHT "I am thinking through how to approach this question." TOKENS 130 DELAY 100ms
  TEXT "Hello! How can I help you today with openagy or your current task?" DELAY 150ms
  USAGE PROMPT 18200 CANDIDATES 18 THOUGHTS 130
  FINISH STOP

# Automated Interaction Steps
BOOT_BOTH
WAIT_READY 10s
SNAPSHOT "01_boot_ready"

TYPE "hi"
ENTER
WAIT_TEXT "Hello!" 15s
SNAPSHOT "02_turn_collapsed"

KEYS "C-o"
SLEEP 500ms
SNAPSHOT "03_thought_expanded"

DIFF
CLEANUP
